Z||000002||stimpy||08-26-2000||02:04 PM||||OK, you've been hazed enough. <P>Some folks have trouble with the PIP. I know it does not work for me as I have web tv (no hard drive to download the program into). In order to post an image, you are linking on to another site. To post the link you use the [IMG] tags, like this...<BR>[IMG]insert your website here[/IMG]<P>One more tip... Don't argue with Canadians. You can't win.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
